---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="BI Dashboards | AuditVerse AI"
  description="Power BI dashboards and business intelligence built directly on your ERP and accounting data."
  canonical="https://www.auditverseai.com/bi-dashboards"
  activePage="bi-dashboards"
>

<section class="page-hero on-dark">
  <div class="hero-grid-lines"></div>
  <div class="wrap" style="position:relative;z-index:2;">
    <div class="breadcrumb"><a href="/">Home</a><span>/</span><span style="color:var(--white)">BI Dashboards</span></div>
    <div class="eyebrow">Business Intelligence</div>
    <h1 style="font-size:clamp(32px,4.6vw,54px);font-weight:800;max-width:820px;color:var(--white);line-height:1.1;">Every KPI, one screen, updated in real time</h1>
    <p class="lede" style="margin-top:20px;">Power BI dashboards and business intelligence built directly on your ERP and accounting data — replacing static month-end decks with a live executive command centre.</p>
    <div class="badge-row" style="margin-top:26px;"><span class="chip"><span class="dot"></span>Power BI</span><span class="chip"><span class="dot"></span>Predictive Analytics</span><span class="chip"><span class="dot"></span>Board Reporting</span></div>
    
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section">
  <div class="wrap two-col">
    <div class="reveal">
      <div class="eyebrow">Data You Can Act On</div>
      <h2 class="headline">Stop reporting on last month. Start seeing this minute.</h2>
      <p class="lede" style="margin-top:14px;">Most companies discover a cash shortfall or a margin slide weeks after it happens — buried in a spreadsheet nobody refreshed. We connect Power BI and custom dashboards directly to your ERP, accounting and operational systems, so leadership sees what's happening as it happens.</p><p class="lede" style="margin-top:14px;">Every dashboard is designed around the decisions it needs to support — not just the data that happens to be available.</p>
      <ul class="list-check" style="margin-top:24px;"><li><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class=""><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"/></svg> Live dashboards refreshed automatically from source systems</li><li><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class=""><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"/></svg> KPI frameworks co-designed with your leadership team, not templated</li><li><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class=""><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"/></svg> Role-based views for the board, CFO, department heads and operations</li></ul>
    </div>
    <div class="img-frame reveal">
      <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1551288049-bebda4e38f71?q=80&w=1200&auto=format&fit=crop" alt="Every KPI, one screen, updated in real time" loading="lazy">
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section on-dark">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="section-head  reveal">
      <div>
        <div class="eyebrow">Capabilities</div>
        <h2 class="headline">Explore what we automate</h2>
        
      </div>
      
    </div>
    <div class="tabs-nav" data-group="bi-dashboards"><button class="tab-btn active" data-tab="powerbi">Power BI Dashboards</button><button class="tab-btn " data-tab="bi">Business Intelligence</button><button class="tab-btn " data-tab="mgmt">Management Reporting</button></div>
    
      <div class="tab-panel active" data-group="bi-dashboards" data-tab="powerbi">
        
          <div class="grid grid-3">
            <div class="card reveal"><div class="icon-box"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class=""><path d="M3 3v18h18"/><rect x="7" y="12" width="3" height="6"/><rect x="12" y="8" width="3" height="10"/><rect x="17" y="5" width="3" height="13"/></svg></div><h4>Executive Dashboards</h4><p>Single-screen views of revenue, margin, cash and KPIs for leadership and the board.</p></div>
            <div class="card reveal"><div class="icon-box"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class=""><path d="m12 2 9 5-9 5-9-5Z"/><path d="m3 12 9 5 9-5"/><path d="m3 17 9 5 9-5"/></svg></div><h4>Departmental Dashboards</h4><p>Tailored views for sales, operations, HR and procurement teams.</p></div>
            <div class="card reveal"><div class="icon-box"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class=""><rect x="6" y="6" width="12" height="12" rx="2"/><path d="M9 2v3"/><path d="M15 2v3"/><path d="M9 19v3"/><path d="M15 19v3"/><path d="M2 9h3"/><path d="M2 15h3"/><path d="M19 9h3"/><path d="M19 15h3"/></svg></div><h4>Automated Data Refresh</h4><p>Direct pipelines from your ERP and accounting systems — no manual exports.</p></div>
          </div>
      </div>
      <div class="tab-panel " data-group="bi-dashboards" data-tab="bi">
        
          <div class="grid grid-3">
            <div class="card reveal"><div class="icon-box"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class=""><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9"/><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="5"/><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="1" fill="currentColor" stroke="none"/></svg></div><h4>KPI Frameworks</h4><p>Defined, agreed KPIs across finance, sales, operations and HR — no more conflicting numbers.</p></div>
            <div class="card reveal"><div class="icon-box"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class=""><path d="m3 17 6-6 4 4 8-8"/><path d="M15 7h6v6"/></svg></div><h4>Predictive Analytics</h4><p>Forecasting models for cash flow, demand and workforce planning.</p></div>
            <div class="card reveal"><div class="icon-box"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class=""><path d="M3 7V5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h2"/><path d="M17 3h2a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v2"/><path d="M21 17v2a2 2 0 0 1-2 2h-2"/><path d="M7 21H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2v-2"/><path d="M7 12h10"/></svg></div><h4>Anomaly Detection</h4><p>Statistical models that flag unusual trends before they become problems.</p></div>
          </div>
      </div>
      <div class="tab-panel " data-group="bi-dashboards" data-tab="mgmt">
        
          <div class="grid grid-3">
            <div class="card reveal"><div class="icon-box"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class=""><path d="M14 2H6a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v16a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h12a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V8Z"/><path d="M14 2v6h6"/><path d="m9 15 2 2 4-4"/></svg></div><h4>Automated Board Packs</h4><p>Board reporting decks generated automatically from live dashboard data.</p></div>
            <div class="card reveal"><div class="icon-box"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class=""><rect x="4" y="9" width="16" height="11" rx="2"/><path d="M12 9V5"/><circle cx="12" cy="3" r="1.4" fill="currentColor" stroke="none"/><circle cx="9" cy="14.5" r="1.2" fill="currentColor" stroke="none"/><circle cx="15" cy="14.5" r="1.2" fill="currentColor" stroke="none"/><path d="M2 13h2"/><path d="M20 13h2"/></svg></div><h4>Management Reporting Bot</h4><p>Daily and weekly digest summaries delivered straight to leadership inboxes.</p></div>
            <div class="card reveal"><div class="icon-box"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class=""><path d="M17 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H7a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2"/><circle cx="10" cy="7" r="4"/><path d="M23 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-3-3.9"/><path d="M16 3.1a4 4 0 0 1 0 7.8"/></svg></div><h4>Role-Based Access</h4><p>Each stakeholder sees exactly the data relevant to their role — nothing more, nothing less.</p></div>
          </div>
      </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="section-head  reveal">
      <div>
        <div class="eyebrow">Benefits</div>
        <h2 class="headline">Why this matters for your bottom line</h2>
        
      </div>
      
    </div>
    <div class="grid grid-4">
      <div class="card reveal"><div class="icon-box"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class=""><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9"/><path d="M12 7v5l3 3"/></svg></div><h4>Real-Time Visibility</h4><p>Dashboards refresh automatically — no more waiting for someone to update a spreadsheet.</p></div>
    
      <div class="card reveal"><div class="icon-box"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class=""><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9"/><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="5"/><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="1" fill="currentColor" stroke="none"/></svg></div><h4>Fewer Reporting Errors</h4><p>One source of truth eliminates the version-control chaos of manual reports.</p></div>
    
      <div class="card reveal"><div class="icon-box"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class=""><path d="M3 3v18h18"/><rect x="7" y="12" width="3" height="6"/><rect x="12" y="8" width="3" height="10"/><rect x="17" y="5" width="3" height="13"/></svg></div><h4>Faster Decisions</h4><p>Leadership acts on current data, not numbers that are three weeks stale.</p></div>
    
      <div class="card reveal"><div class="icon-box"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class=""><path d="M12 2 4 5v6c0 5 3.4 9 8 11 4.6-2 8-6 8-11V5Z"/></svg></div><h4>Anomaly Detection</h4><p>Statistical flags catch unusual patterns in revenue, cost or inventory automatically.</p></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section on-dark">
  <div class="wrap" style="max-width:820px;">
    <div class="section-head  reveal">
      <div>
        <div class="eyebrow">How We Deliver</div>
        <h2 class="headline">Our engagement process</h2>
        
      </div>
      
    </div>
    <div class="timeline reveal">
      <div class="timeline-item reveal">
        <div class="eyebrow" style="margin-bottom:6px;">Step 01</div>
        <h3 class="subhead" style="margin-bottom:8px;">KPI Workshop</h3>
        <p class="lede" style="max-width:640px;">We work with your leadership team to define the metrics that actually drive decisions.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="timeline-item reveal">
        <div class="eyebrow" style="margin-bottom:6px;">Step 02</div>
        <h3 class="subhead" style="margin-bottom:8px;">Data Pipeline Build</h3>
        <p class="lede" style="max-width:640px;">Automated connections are built from your ERP, CRM and accounting systems.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="timeline-item reveal">
        <div class="eyebrow" style="margin-bottom:6px;">Step 03</div>
        <h3 class="subhead" style="margin-bottom:8px;">Dashboard Design</h3>
        <p class="lede" style="max-width:640px;">Executive, departmental and operational dashboards are designed and built in Power BI.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="timeline-item reveal">
        <div class="eyebrow" style="margin-bottom:6px;">Step 04</div>
        <h3 class="subhead" style="margin-bottom:8px;">Validation</h3>
        <p class="lede" style="max-width:640px;">Dashboard figures are reconciled against your financial statements before go-live.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="timeline-item reveal">
        <div class="eyebrow" style="margin-bottom:6px;">Step 05</div>
        <h3 class="subhead" style="margin-bottom:8px;">Rollout &amp; Training</h3>
        <p class="lede" style="max-width:640px;">Your team is trained to read, filter and act on the dashboards independently.</p>
      </div></div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="section-head  reveal">
      <div>
        <div class="eyebrow">Related Services</div>
        <h2 class="headline">Pairs well with</h2>
        
      </div>
      
    </div>
    <div class="grid grid-3">
      <a href="/erp-automation" class="card card reveal"><div class="icon-box"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class=""><rect x="3" y="3" width="6" height="6" rx="1"/><rect x="15" y="15" width="6" height="6" rx="1"/><path d="M9 6h6a3 3 0 0 1 3 3v6"/></svg></div><h4>ERP Automation</h4><p>The clean, structured data your dashboards are built on.</p></a>
    
      <a href="/internal-audit" class="card card reveal"><div class="icon-box"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class=""><path d="M12 2 4 5v6c0 5 3.4 9 8 11 4.6-2 8-6 8-11V5Z"/></svg></div><h4>Internal Audit</h4><p>Continuous monitoring dashboards for risk and controls.</p></a>
    
      <a href="/accounting-bookkeeping" class="card card reveal"><div class="icon-box"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class=""><path d="M4 2h16v20l-3-2-2 2-2-2-2 2-2-2-2 2-3-2Z"/><path d="M8 7h8"/><path d="M8 11h8"/><path d="M8 15h5"/></svg></div><h4>Accounting &amp; Bookkeeping</h4><p>Live financial data straight from your books.</p></a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>


<section class="section on-dark">
  <div class="wrap" style="max-width:840px;">
    <div class="section-head center">
      <div class="eyebrow center" style="justify-content:center;">FAQ</div>
      <h2 class="headline">Frequently asked questions</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="reveal">
      <div class="acc-item">
        <div class="acc-q">Do we need Power BI licences already? <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class=""><path d="M12 5v14"/><path d="M5 12h14"/></svg></div>
        <div class="acc-a"><p>No — we can advise on and help procure the right Power BI licensing tier as part of the engagement.</p></div>
      </div>
      <div class="acc-item">
        <div class="acc-q">Can dashboards combine data from multiple systems? <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class=""><path d="M12 5v14"/><path d="M5 12h14"/></svg></div>
        <div class="acc-a"><p>Yes, this is the norm — most clients combine ERP, CRM, HR and banking data into a single dashboard suite.</p></div>
      </div>
      <div class="acc-item">
        <div class="acc-q">How often do the dashboards refresh? <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class=""><path d="M12 5v14"/><path d="M5 12h14"/></svg></div>
        <div class="acc-a"><p>Most dashboards refresh in real time or on an hourly schedule, depending on the source system's API capability.</p></div>
      </div></div>
  </div>
</section>


<section class="section-tight on-dark">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="cta-band reveal">
      <h2 class="headline center" style="max-width:640px;position:relative;z-index:1;">Ready to put Every KPI, one screen, updated in real time to work?</h2>
      <p class="lede center" style="margin-top:16px;position:relative;z-index:1;">Book a free consultation and get a tailored automation roadmap within 5 business days.</p>
      <div class="hero-actions center" style="justify-content:center;position:relative;z-index:1;">
        <a href="/contact" class="btn btn-gold">Book Free Consultation <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class=""><path d="M5 12h14"/><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"/></svg></a>
        <a href="/contact" class="btn btn-outline">Schedule Demo</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

</BaseLayout>
